          ],
          "text": "You came into hospital because of:\n- low mood that had been getting worse over 6 weeks\n- loss of interest in things you usually enjoy\n- waking early in the morning\n- reduced appetite and around 4 kg of weight loss\n- poor concentration\n- thoughts of suicide, including thoughts of overdose\n\nThe team found you were having a depressive episode with active suicidal ideation.\n\nThe team also noted some things in your life that had been difficult:\n- a recent relationship breakdown\n- stress at work"
