          "heading": "what_we_did",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.2",
            "sections.3"
          ],
          "text": "The team checked in with you each day.\n\nBy Day 3 (20/05), your sleep had slightly improved and your suicidal thoughts were less intense.\n\nBy Day 5 (22/05), your mood was improving and your suicidal thoughts were fleeting and passive, with no intent.\n\nDuring your stay, the team:\n- started you on an antidepressant (sertraline) on Day 3 (20/05)\n- gave you information about your condition (psychoeducation)\n- completed a safety plan with you\n- carried out a full team review on Day 5 (22/05)"
